## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design per-tenant cost controls for tracing in a multi-tenant Kubernetes cluster. Covers CRD/controller patterns, tracing stack integration, safe pause/resume semantics, and observability under bursty traffic.

## Key Concepts

- Kubernetes CRD and controller pattern
- Per-namespace budgeting with per-service overrides
- Tracing stack integration (Tempo/OpenTelemetry) and config propagation
- Safe pause/resume with reset windows and metrics
- Observability and alerting

